# agent-orchestrator commit message template (issue #5).
# Enable with:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
# Lines starting with '#' are stripped from the final message.

<type>(<scope>): <short summary>
# imperative, <= 72 chars. Types: feat / fix / refactor / docs / chore / test.
# Example:  feat(foundation): add repo scaffold + agent-instruction layering

<why: motivation / context>
<what: the change>

Refs kushin77/agent-orchestrator#<issue>
# Every commit references its issue (GR-2).
# Example:  Refs kushin77/agent-orchestrator#5

AI-assistance: <runtime> (<mode>)
# Example:  AI-assistance: Copilot (Relentless, flash/LOW)
